findings.body:
`provider_scopes` is documented as an array-only query param, but the handler accepts either a single string or an array (`t.union([t.string, t.array(t.string), t.undefined])`). This mismatch reduces accuracy and can mislead clients. To reflect actual behavior, define the query parameter schema with `oneOf` allowing both a string and an array of strings.
```suggestion
  @ApiQuery({
    name: 'provider_scopes',
    required: false,
    schema: {
      oneOf: [
        { type: 'string' },
        { type: 'array', items: { type: 'string' } },
      ],
      example: ['openid', 'profile', 'email'],
    },
    description:
      'Additional OAuth scopes to request from the identity provider.',
  })
```
